<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Food Price Index rises 0.1 pct in June qtr.</title>
<headline>NZ Food Price Index rises 0.1 pct in June qtr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data for the Food Price Index for June:</p>
<p>    June 1997		  May 1997	     June 1996</p>
<p>    +0.1 pct		   -0.8 pct		-0.2 pct</p>
<p>    yr-end June 1997     yr-end May 1997   yr-end June 1996</p>
<p>    +2.0 pct		  +1.7 pct		 +1.1 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
